WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:03.603
-The Trump administration
officially gave up

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:05.638
on containing the coronavirus
pandemic,

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:08.475
even as the country set
new records for daily cases

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:10.610
and the White House faced
its second outbreak.

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:13.279
For more on this, it's time
for "A Closer Look."

00:00:13.279 --> 00:00:17.283 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:20.086
The Trump campaign and its
allies in the right-wing media

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:23.022
have been desperate to re-create
the 2016 election

00:00:23.022 --> 00:00:26.125
by manufacturing fake scandals
and supposed gaffs

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:27.626
they think can tank Joe Biden.

00:00:27.626 --> 00:00:30.296
For example, they thought
they had a golden opportunity

00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:32.798
to shift the focus of the race
last week when Biden

00:00:32.798 --> 00:00:36.269
made the shocking suggestion
that we should maybe think about

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:38.104
transitioning away
from fossil fuels

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:39.806
which are rapidly killing
the planet.

00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:42.041
-Would you close down
the oil industry?

00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:46.279
-I would transition
from the oil industry, yes.

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:47.847
-Oh. That's a big statement.
-I would transition.

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:50.516
The is big statement
because I would stop --

00:00:50.516 --> 00:00:53.219
-Why would you do that?
-Because the oil industry

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:55.654
pollutes significantly.
-Oh, I see.

00:00:55.654 --> 00:00:57.523
-Here's the deal --
-That's a big statement.

00:00:57.523 --> 00:00:59.725
-Well, if you let me finish the
statement --

00:00:59.725 --> 00:01:03.796
Because the has to be replaced
by renewable energy over time.

00:01:03.796 --> 00:01:06.633
-That's maybe the biggest
statement in terms of business,

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:08.334
that's the biggest statement
because basically...

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:09.602
-Okay.
We have one final question.

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:11.103
...what he's saying
is he is going to destroy

00:01:11.103 --> 00:01:14.673
the oil industry.
Will you remember that, Texas?

00:01:14.673 --> 00:01:16.509
Will you remember that,
Pennsylvania, Oklahoma...

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:18.678
-Vice President Biden, let me
give you 10 seconds to respond.

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:20.346
-...Ohio.
-Trump has no chill.

00:01:20.346 --> 00:01:22.415
He's like a guy on a first date
saying,

00:01:22.415 --> 00:01:24.450
[ As Trump ] When we go back
to my place, I hope you remember

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:25.784
that I paid for dinner, Janet.

00:01:25.784 --> 00:01:27.887
Will you remember that?
Will you?

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:29.288
[ Normal voice ] There's
something especially pathetic

00:01:29.288 --> 00:01:30.389
about plaintive Trump.

00:01:30.389 --> 00:01:32.091
It's like watching
the neighborhood dog

00:01:32.091 --> 00:01:33.392
that's always barking at
neighbors

00:01:33.392 --> 00:01:34.893
and rifling through their trash

00:01:34.893 --> 00:01:37.563
suddenly moping around with a
cone around his neck.

00:01:37.563 --> 00:01:39.565
[ As Trump ] Will you please
give me a treat, Ohio?

00:01:39.565 --> 00:01:41.334
[ Normal voice ] Of course,
what Biden said isn't even

00:01:41.334 --> 00:01:44.336
remotely controversial --
57% of voters say they

00:01:44.336 --> 00:01:46.538
support transitioning
from oil to renewables,

00:01:46.538 --> 00:01:48.174
while only 28% oppose it,

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:50.543
and let's not forget --
large parts of the west

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:53.412
are on fire and sea levels
in South Florida could rise

00:01:53.412 --> 00:01:55.615
more than a foot by 2045.

00:01:55.615 --> 00:01:57.750
Trump can deny climate change
all he wants,

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:00.320
but it will be very real to him
when Mar-a-Lago is underwater --

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:02.689
you know, literally,
instead of just financially.

00:02:02.689 --> 00:02:05.325
Although it'll probably be fine
underwater

00:02:05.325 --> 00:02:08.260
since it already looks like
a castle in a fish tank.

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:10.596
"At Mar-a-Lago we offer
first-class amenities

00:02:10.596 --> 00:02:12.365
like a golf course,
a swimming pool,

00:02:12.365 --> 00:02:14.900
and free food flakes
twice a day.

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:16.636
And if you need a restaurant
recommendation,

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:19.038
just ask Old-Timey Diver Man.

00:02:19.038 --> 00:02:20.974
So Trump struck out
on his one attempt

00:02:20.974 --> 00:02:22.308
to change the focus of the race.

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:23.409
Meanwhile, in that same debate,

00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:25.144
the president said
the coronavirus pandemic

00:02:25.144 --> 00:02:27.012
which is currently setting
new case records

00:02:27.012 --> 00:02:29.782
and raging out of control,
was basically over.

00:02:29.782 --> 00:02:31.617
-We're fighting it,
and we're fighting it hard.

00:02:31.617 --> 00:02:33.553
There is a spike.
There was a spike in Florida,

00:02:33.553 --> 00:02:34.920
and it's now gone.

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:37.956
There was a very big spike
in Texas. It's now gone.

00:02:37.956 --> 00:02:41.060
There was a very big spike
in Arizona. It's now gone.

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:44.263
And there are some spikes
and surges in other places,

00:02:44.263 --> 00:02:45.598
they will soon be gone.

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:47.967
I can tell you
from personal experience

00:02:47.967 --> 00:02:52.505
that I was in the hospital,
I had it, and I got better.

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:55.374
-Okay, but that's kind of like
George Clooney telling you

00:02:55.374 --> 00:02:57.277
a restaurant has really good
service.

00:02:57.277 --> 00:02:59.112
I mean, they treated me like
a real celebrity.

00:02:59.112 --> 00:03:00.846
You had the best medical care
in the world

00:03:00.846 --> 00:03:03.116
and a Army of doctors
around you 24/7

00:03:03.116 --> 00:03:06.285
like a NASCAR pit crew fixing up
a '76 Dodge Dart.

00:03:06.285 --> 00:03:08.754
"Quick, just put some duct tape
on the windshield."

00:03:08.754 --> 00:03:10.656
Even worse,
as he was saying that,

00:03:10.656 --> 00:03:13.293
all, every single one of
the states he name checked --

00:03:13.293 --> 00:03:15.028
Texas, Florida, and Arizona

00:03:15.028 --> 00:03:17.363
were seeing major spikes
in COVID cases.

00:03:17.363 --> 00:03:19.899
Patients in El Paso are being
air lifted to other hospitals

00:03:19.899 --> 00:03:21.167
because they're at capacity.

00:03:21.167 --> 00:03:22.901
Nine months into the outbreak,

00:03:22.901 --> 00:03:25.538
we're sill setting records
for new daily cases

00:03:25.538 --> 00:03:27.272
with 85,000 on Friday alone,

00:03:27.272 --> 00:03:30.008
meaning about one in 4,000
Americans got COVID

00:03:30.008 --> 00:03:32.946
on just that one day,
which is an insane statistic.

00:03:32.946 --> 00:03:36.682
That's something you'd read on
a really depressing Snapple cap.

00:03:36.682 --> 00:03:38.985
You know, along with "The
average person spends 2 weeks

00:03:38.985 --> 00:03:41.687
over their lifetime waiting
for a traffic light to change."

00:03:41.687 --> 00:03:43.422
Oh, man. That's such a bummer.

00:03:43.422 --> 00:03:44.824
Oh, wait..
What does this side say?

00:03:44.824 --> 00:03:47.260
Ugh, diet peach?

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:49.795
This much is clear --
Trump White House has given up.

00:03:49.795 --> 00:03:52.764
While hundreds of thousands
of Americans needlessly die

00:03:52.764 --> 00:03:54.867
from a virus that can be
contained,

00:03:54.867 --> 00:03:57.303
the President and his aides
are waving the white flag

00:03:57.303 --> 00:03:58.637
and telling you
to fend for yourself.

00:03:58.637 --> 00:04:00.206
Trump's Chief of Staff
Mark Meadows

00:04:00.206 --> 00:04:01.641
admitted as much on Sunday.

00:04:01.641 --> 00:04:04.009
-We're not going to control
the pandemic.

00:04:04.009 --> 00:04:07.547
We are gonna control the fact
that we get vaccines,

00:04:07.547 --> 00:04:09.415
therapeutics,
and other mitigation.

00:04:09.415 --> 00:04:10.917
-Why aren't we going to get
control of the pandemic?

00:04:10.917 --> 00:04:15.054
-Because it is a contagious
virus just like the flu.

00:04:15.054 --> 00:04:18.357
-At this point, the mayor from
"Jaws" would be an upgrade.

00:04:18.357 --> 00:04:20.960
At least in that movie,
the mayor was in denial.

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:23.963
He wasn't going around saying,
"Look, sharks gotta eat, too.

00:04:23.963 --> 00:04:26.265
Now help me push these
kids into the ocean!"

00:04:26.265 --> 00:04:28.501
Since the outset of the
pandemic, it's been clear

00:04:28.501 --> 00:04:30.536
that the president has no
interest in doing anything

00:04:30.536 --> 00:04:32.271
other than whining about it.

00:04:32.271 --> 00:04:34.006
For example,
as the country faces

00:04:34.006 --> 00:04:36.676
a once-in-a-century cataclysm
that has sickened millions

00:04:36.676 --> 00:04:39.579
and put many more out of work,
Trump had as added a new refrain

00:04:39.579 --> 00:04:41.981
to his campaign rallies, which
he repeated over the weekend

00:04:41.981 --> 00:04:44.283
and again today, complaining
that the media

00:04:44.283 --> 00:04:46.184
won't stop talking about COVID.

00:04:46.184 --> 00:04:47.453
-We're rounding the turn.

00:04:47.453 --> 00:04:49.188
You know, all they want to talk
about is COVID.

00:04:49.188 --> 00:04:51.157
By the way, on November 4th,
you are won't be hearing

00:04:51.157 --> 00:04:52.424
so much about it.

00:04:52.424 --> 00:04:55.128
COVID, COVID, COVID.

00:04:55.128 --> 00:04:57.763
COVID!

00:04:57.763 --> 00:04:59.598
Today, let's talk about COVID.

00:04:59.598 --> 00:05:01.300
-That's all I hear about now.

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:03.102
That's all I hear.
Turn on television,

00:05:03.102 --> 00:05:06.238
COVID, COVID, COVID,
COVID, COVID, COVID.

00:05:06.238 --> 00:05:08.607
A plane goes down,
500 people dead,

00:05:08.607 --> 00:05:09.876
they don't talk about it.

00:05:09.876 --> 00:05:12.411
COVID, COVID, COVID, COVID.

00:05:12.411 --> 00:05:15.247
By the way, on November 4th,
you won't hear about it anymore.

00:05:15.247 --> 00:05:17.449
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:17.449 --> 00:05:20.119
COVID! COVID!

00:05:20.119 --> 00:05:22.221
Please don't go and vote, COVID.

00:05:22.221 --> 00:05:23.422
-What's up with that voice?

00:05:23.422 --> 00:05:25.024
Why is he shouting
the word "COVID"

00:05:25.024 --> 00:05:28.160
like a suburban stepdad calling
his teenage son down for dinner?

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:32.197
COVID! COVID?!

00:05:32.197 --> 00:05:35.134
Dinner's ready. COVID!

00:05:35.134 --> 00:05:40.106
I made jambalaya!
COVID?!

00:05:40.106 --> 00:05:45.144
COVID!

00:05:45.144 --> 00:05:47.280
COVID!!

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:49.982
Well, then why did he leave?

00:05:49.982 --> 00:05:52.218
Why did your real father leave,
COVID?!

00:05:52.218 --> 00:05:56.121
[ Laughter ]

00:05:56.121 --> 00:05:58.324
[Mouthing]
"Oh, that was my fault?

00:05:58.324 --> 00:06:01.427
Will you go get him?

00:06:01.427 --> 00:06:03.362
You go get him!"

00:06:03.362 --> 00:06:06.131
[ Normal voice ] COVID?!

00:06:06.131 --> 00:06:08.968
COVID! I'm --

00:06:08.968 --> 00:06:10.769
[ Chuckles ]

00:06:10.769 --> 00:06:12.071
As he was saying that,

00:06:12.071 --> 00:06:14.273
the White House was dealing with
a second COVID outbreak,

00:06:14.273 --> 00:06:15.908
this time in the
Vice President's office.

00:06:15.908 --> 00:06:17.643
About 800 Americans
are dying a day.

00:06:17.643 --> 00:06:21.413
Of course, of course
it's the number-one story.

00:06:21.413 --> 00:06:23.583
If that fake plan crash
you made up was happening

00:06:23.583 --> 00:06:26.685
every single day, then that
would be the main story, too.

00:06:26.685 --> 00:06:29.822
No matter what's going on in the
world, Trump will only be happy

00:06:29.822 --> 00:06:31.590
if every time you turn on
the evening news,

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:34.593
the top story is
"Handsome President Wows Nation

00:06:34.593 --> 00:06:37.329
With Dance Moves."
When if anything, he looks like

00:06:37.329 --> 00:06:40.132
a serial killer trying to wiggle
out of a straight jacket.

00:06:40.132 --> 00:06:42.735
My favorite is when he moves
his arm back and forth

00:06:42.735 --> 00:06:45.571
like he's softly fighting off
an old mugger.

00:06:45.571 --> 00:06:46.806
[ Old man voice ]
Unh! Give me your wallet.

00:06:46.806 --> 00:06:48.941
[ As Trump ] I'm not
gonna let you do that.

00:06:48.941 --> 00:06:51.443
That's a dance you're doing when
you're trying on a new jacket.

00:06:51.443 --> 00:06:54.747
Just want to make sure I can get
stuff off a high shelf.

00:06:54.747 --> 00:06:57.850
Also, why are you making up
a fake plane crash?

00:06:57.850 --> 00:07:00.786
Is this the same plane that had
all your imaginary

00:07:00.786 --> 00:07:02.754
anarchist thugs on it, too?

00:07:02.754 --> 00:07:05.524
-We had somebody get on a plane
from a certain city

00:07:05.524 --> 00:07:09.294
this weekend, and in the plane
it was almost completely loaded

00:07:09.294 --> 00:07:13.432
with thugs wearing these
dark uniforms,

00:07:13.432 --> 00:07:15.934
black uniforms with gear
and this and that.

00:07:15.934 --> 00:07:19.572
The person was on a plane,
said that there were about

00:07:19.572 --> 00:07:23.642
Six people like that person,
more or less,

00:07:23.642 --> 00:07:27.079
and what happened is the entire
plane filled up with

00:07:27.079 --> 00:07:29.815
the looters, the anarchists,
the rioters,

00:07:29.815 --> 00:07:31.984
people that obviously were
looking for trouble.

00:07:31.984 --> 00:07:33.552
-[ As Trump ] They were
wearing dark uniforms,

00:07:33.552 --> 00:07:36.321
and to cover their tracks,
they crashed the plane

00:07:36.321 --> 00:07:37.457
and parachuted to safety.

00:07:37.457 --> 00:07:40.626
I saw it in a documentary
about The Batman.

00:07:40.626 --> 00:07:43.062
We love The Batman,
don't we, folks?

00:07:43.062 --> 00:07:44.930
Don't we?
'Cause he's got the cape,

00:07:44.930 --> 00:07:47.166
he's got the cowl,
the whole deal.

00:07:47.166 --> 00:07:50.436
Suburban women,
they love The Batman.

00:07:50.436 --> 00:07:53.338
We've had more Batmen under
my administration

00:07:53.338 --> 00:07:55.707
than any other in history.

00:07:55.707 --> 00:07:58.977
Obama only had the one Batman,
so rude.

00:07:58.977 --> 00:08:02.248
So rude, his Batman.
Yelled at the sound guy.

00:08:02.248 --> 00:08:03.850
[ Laughter ]

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:05.918
Have you seen Obama's Batman
lately?

00:08:05.918 --> 00:08:10.356
Gained a lot of weight.
Fat Batman now.

00:08:10.356 --> 00:08:13.693
Not my Batman.

00:08:13.693 --> 00:08:16.128
[ Normal voice ] COVID!
[ Chuckles ]

00:08:16.128 --> 00:08:17.830
This may be a rhetorical change,

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:19.832
but it's not really much
of a change in policy

00:08:19.832 --> 00:08:22.268
since the Trump White House
has from the beginning

00:08:22.268 --> 00:08:24.236
decided to forfeit and let
the virus

00:08:24.236 --> 00:08:25.704
run rampant across the country.

00:08:25.704 --> 00:08:28.040
Just last week,
Dr. Anthony Fauci said

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:30.642
he hadn't spoken directly
with President Trump in a while

00:08:30.642 --> 00:08:32.511
and added that Trump
stopped going

00:08:32.511 --> 00:08:35.147
to coronavirus task force
meetings months ago.

00:08:35.147 --> 00:08:37.983
-When was the last time you
had the president

00:08:37.983 --> 00:08:41.086
at one of these task force
meetings?

00:08:41.086 --> 00:08:45.991
-At a task force meeting,
that was several months ago.

00:08:45.991 --> 00:08:50.195
-Donald Trump? Why, I haven't
heard that names in years.

00:08:50.195 --> 00:08:53.165
Poor guy must feel like
Kevin Smith's stylish.

00:08:53.165 --> 00:08:57.503
Just please try the long pants.
It's winter, Kevin.

00:08:57.503 --> 00:08:59.738
Oh, look at this.
This is when Kevin Smith was on.

00:08:59.738 --> 00:09:03.809
He gave us a joint.
[ Chuckles ] We still have it.

00:09:03.809 --> 00:09:05.344
Thank you, Kevin.

00:09:05.344 --> 00:09:06.712
That's right.
Trump hasn't been to

00:09:06.712 --> 00:09:08.881
a coronavirus task force meeting
in several months.

00:09:08.881 --> 00:09:10.582
I guess he's been too busy,
I don't know,

00:09:10.582 --> 00:09:13.252
sparring with an invisible
punching bag.

00:09:13.252 --> 00:09:15.221
Months ago, Trump decided
instead of providing

00:09:15.221 --> 00:09:17.256
any leadership at all,
he just lets states

00:09:17.256 --> 00:09:19.792
fend for themselves and then
blame the so-called blue states

00:09:19.792 --> 00:09:22.761
for doing a bad job, which,
A, isn't even true,

00:09:22.761 --> 00:09:24.630
and B, is disgusting.
I mean, can you imagine

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:26.064
Barack Obama telling a red state

00:09:26.064 --> 00:09:27.833
to go screw itself
during a crisis?

00:09:27.833 --> 00:09:29.001
You can't.

00:09:29.001 --> 00:09:32.371
[ As Barack ] Idaho?
More like, uh, Ida-no!

00:09:32.371 --> 00:09:35.908
[ Laughter ]

00:09:35.908 --> 00:09:40.079
You say potato,
I say, uh [bleep] off.

00:09:40.079 --> 00:09:43.115
[ Laughter ]

00:09:43.115 --> 00:09:44.817
[ Normal voice ] But until now,
the Trump White House

00:09:44.817 --> 00:09:48.754
has at least lied and pretended
their goal was to contain

00:09:48.754 --> 00:09:51.157
the virus, proclaiming victory
multiple times

00:09:51.157 --> 00:09:52.557
over the course of the outbreak.

00:09:52.557 --> 00:09:55.427
-Thanks to President Trump's
historically aggressive

00:09:55.427 --> 00:09:58.296
containment efforts,
we've actually contained

00:09:58.296 --> 00:10:00.566
the spread of this virus
here in the United States.

00:10:00.566 --> 00:10:04.703
-We have contained this.
We have contained this.

00:10:04.703 --> 00:10:08.273
I won't say airtight,
but pretty close to airtight.

00:10:08.273 --> 00:10:11.109
-So far, it looks relatively
contained,

00:10:11.109 --> 00:10:13.145
and we don't think
most people -- I mean,

00:10:13.145 --> 00:10:16.215
the vast majority of Americans
are not at risk for this virus.

00:10:16.215 --> 00:10:17.749
-It is being contained.

00:10:17.749 --> 00:10:19.385
Do you not think
it's being contained?

00:10:19.385 --> 00:10:20.786
-I'm not a doctor.
I'm a lawyer.

00:10:20.786 --> 00:10:22.821
-Well, you said it's not being
contained.

00:10:22.821 --> 00:10:24.256
So are you a doctor or lawyer

00:10:24.256 --> 00:10:25.624
when you say
it's not being contained?

00:10:25.624 --> 00:10:27.392
That's false. You just said
something that's not true.

00:10:27.392 --> 00:10:29.028
-The virus is spreading.
-Missed you, Kellyanne.

00:10:29.028 --> 00:10:30.829
No one was better at being wrong

00:10:30.829 --> 00:10:32.531
and condescending
at the same time.

00:10:32.531 --> 00:10:33.832
She's like the Dowager Countess

00:10:33.832 --> 00:10:35.834
if Maggie Smith was from
Long Island

00:10:35.834 --> 00:10:37.369
and flunked out
of community college.

00:10:37.369 --> 00:10:39.671
[ Posh accent ] I like my tea
served the proper way,

00:10:39.671 --> 00:10:41.940
with gin, rum, vodka,
and tequila.

00:10:41.940 --> 00:10:43.842
I hope that tape gets replayed
over and over

00:10:43.842 --> 00:10:45.010
for the rest
of Kellyanne's life.

00:10:45.010 --> 00:10:47.279
She's like a pilot
on the Hindenberg saying,

00:10:47.279 --> 00:10:50.249
"Do you not thing we're landing
safely? Are you a pilot?"

00:10:50.249 --> 00:10:52.151
[ Mimics fire extinguisher
hissing ]

00:10:52.151 --> 00:10:53.419
"Oh, the humanity?

00:10:53.419 --> 00:10:55.587
I think we're a little tired
of that sentiment."

00:10:55.587 --> 00:10:57.989
It's been clear from day one
that the president and his party

00:10:57.989 --> 00:11:00.959
don't care about the hundreds
of thousands of Americans

00:11:00.959 --> 00:11:03.595
who have died and the millions
more who have gotten sick

00:11:03.595 --> 00:11:04.930
and lost their jobs.

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:06.899
They were willing to stomach
all of that

00:11:06.899 --> 00:11:09.134
for a 6-3 conservative
super majority

00:11:09.134 --> 00:11:10.402
on the Supreme Court.

00:11:10.402 --> 00:11:12.104
Trump and his aides are
surrendering to the virus

00:11:12.104 --> 00:11:13.705
and telling Americans
you're on your own.

00:11:13.705 --> 00:11:16.475
So I guess if you live
in a swing state

00:11:16.475 --> 00:11:18.844
and you're watching this,
I would just like to say...

00:11:18.844 --> 00:11:20.312
-Will you remember that, Texas?

00:11:20.312 --> 00:11:22.214
Will you remember that,
Pennsylvania?

00:11:22.214 --> 00:11:24.016
-This has been "A Closer Look."

